Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.01,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}1{\c} {\c&HB2A7FF&}2{\c} {\c&HFFA0D2&}3{\c} {\c&H84E1FF&}4
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:10.27,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}隠してもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:10.27,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}藏着也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:11.65,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFDDA4&}アピってもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:11.65,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&\}表现出来也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.29,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}フィクションのラブコメは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.29,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}书本里的恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:14.37,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}嘘ばかり…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:14.37,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}那都是假的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.73,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}焦ったらバレ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.73,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}一着急就会露馅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.19,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}デレちゃったら負け？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.19,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}害羞了就输了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:19.01,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}下心隠すのも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:19.01,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}七七八八小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:19.95,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}必死です!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:19.95,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}非得藏住不可！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.32,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}触ってもいい？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.32,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}可以摸你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:22.70,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}ドキッてしてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:22.70,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}有没有心动？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:24.33,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}子ども扱いしても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:24.33,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}把我成当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:25.41,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}変わんない{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:25.41,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}我也不会收敛哦{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.91,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}分かってないな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.91,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}你还是不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:28.29,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}ズバッといきな！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:28.29,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}那我就直说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:29.96,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}親友の特権も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:29.96,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}我或许也有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:31.08,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}あるかも...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:31.08,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}身为亲友的特权……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.75,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作戦も駆け引きも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.75,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作战也好、计谋也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:35.96,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}君には届かない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:35.96,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}对你统统没用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:39.25,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}どうして好きにさせたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:39.25,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我为什么会喜欢你？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:44.57,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}ラブコメは両思いじゃなきゃダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:44.57,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}恋爱喜剧就一定得是两情相悦！
