Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.74,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,gradiente @3c1 88,{\clip(1390,1002,1400,1076)\pos(960,1070)\1c&H84E1FF&}真的会心跳个不停、被狠狠击中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.74,0:02:07.99,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}“I”に誓って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.74,0:02:07.99,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}对“我”发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:09.54,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}“LOVE”に沼って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:09.54,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}让你沉浸在“爱”中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.66,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}“YOU”を虜にしちゃお
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.66,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}最终把“你”俘获
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:12.89,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}あいらびゅ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:12.89,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:17.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你们两个是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:21.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,没事没事 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:24.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真的很怀念耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:25.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:29.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你以前也很常带点心过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:31.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,快换个话题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:34.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对了对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:37.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,当时我们之间的惩罚游戏\N还是吃Pocky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:39.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:42.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,然后一个不小心我们就亲下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,超恶心的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.19,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(惊)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:46.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,然后啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春 这件事就…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:49.19,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不能说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:51.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,亲下去了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真的亲下去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:56.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不过你看 她们嫉妒了 有戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:59.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,确定是嫉妒 不是幻灭?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,反正这是小时候的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不能算数 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:06.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,而且是跟英雄耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.67,Text CN,,0,0,0,,一点都不浪漫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,虽说是亲下去了 但只有一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,而且还碰到牙齿 超痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:18.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,根本就不是什么大事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:20.81,Text CN,,0,0,0,,拜托你 别说得这么详细
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好地狱…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我收到伴手礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:28.69,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是章鱼仙贝 要不要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:32.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,嘴巴嘟嘟 章鱼…仙贝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:35.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,加入满满章鱼"亲亲"华
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:37.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(怒火中烧)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,谁快来救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:41.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:43.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,有客人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你回来得正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你看 她是阿春 是阿春哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:52.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.96,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我们有几年没见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子 你长大好多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:02.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:06.73,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:09.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,青蛙好可怕 青蛙好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,青蛙?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是人家的心理创伤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,小青蛙 小青蛙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,啯啯啯啯 小青蛙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:21.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,啯啯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我带了好东西过来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:30.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(啯啯啯啯啯…)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子喜欢青蛙对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.01,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不对 是小青蛙…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:38.51,Text CN,,0,0,0,,来 喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,滑溜溜的好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:56.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:04.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我当时以为你会很开心…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:07.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子 对不起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:10.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子 我都跟你道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,青蛙好可怕 青蛙好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.91,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,别跑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.80,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我说了 是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:18.12,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:18.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,虽然对留奈子不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:18.91,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,留奈子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:19.66,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:20.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,但多亏她我才得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:20.62,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,等等我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:23.43,Text CN,,0,0,0,,人家还没做好心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这也…不算数吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,拜托你当作不算数
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:11.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:13.70,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:13.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可恶 她们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:16.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我的内心都已经这么动摇了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:21.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,接吻了 接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:23.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他们接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,连阿春也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,该不会连阿春也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:35.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好羡慕阿春哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:43.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,以前明明就没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:58.86,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(小心闯空门)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:06:59.40,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:06:59.40,Note,,0,0,0,,与接吻同音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.41,Note,,0,0,0,,与接吻同音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:07.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,挥之不去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:23.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春该不会对英雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:26.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.55,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.80,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:38.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我不小心跌了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真是笨手笨脚的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那你小心点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我能跟你一起跑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:56.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我要不要再跑慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,了不起 跟英雄完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:05.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,前阵子我们打一对一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他完全动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:08.97,Text CN,,0,0,0,,逗弄他一下 他就满脸通红
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,笑死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你…喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,因为你吻到他后感觉很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.66,0:08:28.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:30.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,既然你这么在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:34.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就表示你其实喜欢英雄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对吧 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:41.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,别跑太快 会累垮的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:49.88,Text CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:53.89,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你以前常说\N"好奸诈 每次都跟阿春玩"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,下次跟我们一起玩啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:09:00.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你一定是在嫉妒我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:04.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他第一次牵手的对象是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:10.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,洗澡 吵架 还有喂食的\N初次对象都是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我才不会嫉妒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不 你明明就很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:17.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你还不是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你从刚才就在全速冲刺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我每次都跑这么快啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:25.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,每次? 你是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:26.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,要你啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,承认吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,阿春才是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我只是那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.19,Text CN,,0,0,0,,青梅竹马而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:45.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我也是青梅竹马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,才不是那样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:10:00.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这也…不算数吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:04.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:06.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你流了好多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,一大清早的 你去做什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:11.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就…有点事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:12.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.34,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我正要吃早…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:47.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我得去洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:52.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:11:00.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,柔软的肌肤触感
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,有如天使之吻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.98,Note,,0,0,0,,天使之吻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,掉咯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:08.20,Note,,0,0,0,,早安新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:08.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,下一则新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.70,Note,,0,0,0,,有Kiss的发音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,新时代的钉书器备受注目
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:12.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.91,0:11:15.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥 掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:19.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这个时期 请小心闯空门
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:19.00,Note,,0,0,0,,有Kiss的发音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我刚才好像跟人接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,接吻了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:30.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这样会发展成恋爱喜剧耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:41.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这两天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:45.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那家伙…是以什么样的心情度过的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:50.15,Text CN,,0,0,0,,还有我该以什么表情面对她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我的外型打扮 没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:00.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你不进去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,快进去吧 老师要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,各位同学 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,功课写了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:14.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:15.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你们每次每次…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:18.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,都感情这么好地一起上学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:19.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:22.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:22.95,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,对啊 然后啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:24.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:27.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐 我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,等等…我想跟你聊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:35.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那我们先回家咯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:37.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:43.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,咦 咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:49.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留 奈 子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子 你也要回家了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好巧哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你不要靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,鸡皮疙瘩 鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不要这么冷淡嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我们聊聊美好回忆忘掉恐惧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.54,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,你不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我帮你忘掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:11.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那是英雄对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是看起来好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他的背后毫无防备哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.36,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss Kiss 我们明明接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:24.37,Note,,0,0,0,,突然被女生KISS!?\N其背后真正的含意与最佳对应方法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:24.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,为什么她能当作什么都没发生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:26.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真的没发生过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你们两个干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,没有啊 就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,什么Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:36.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:40.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 你之前不是说不算数吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:44.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你该不会对阿春…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:45.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不是啦 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:47.64,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我才不是在说阿春
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不是我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:55.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:56.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥跟谁亲亲了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,跟谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:01.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是我以外的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,而且现在查资料 就表示是最近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:07.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不对 不是 什么事都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了 是灯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对了 之前的恋爱故事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不是啦 是汐啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不是的 我说的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:18.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,气死人的冷淡态度啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:22.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,有女生对我朋友态度超冷淡\N他很气啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:28.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你还这么热心帮他查资料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:31.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那…那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:35.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他好像…突然被女性朋友亲了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:36.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是再次见面时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:39.82,Text CN,,0,0,0,,对方却一副\N什么都没发生过…的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:43.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,所以我很好奇到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:46.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不喜欢的话就不会亲下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:51.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你也主动一点 去亲她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:53.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你…你在说什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:57.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不确认对方是否对自己有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.46,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就接吻的话太不纯洁了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:01.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你不懂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:03.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这种事要靠气势
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:06.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不对 心意很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:08.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,要先好好诉诸言语
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:09.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.60,Text CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥是怎么想的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:16.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢汐姐姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢就直说喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你们是青梅竹马嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.25,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不 我说的是我朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是谁都没差啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:27.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,既然是青梅竹马 更要靠气势
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,少婆婆妈妈的 直接推倒就对了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:31.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,一定要先说清楚哦 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,青梅竹马
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:44.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我不知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我想象不到怎么跟青梅竹马\N发展成恋爱喜剧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:48.01,Text CN,,0,0,0,,拖拖拉拉 不甘不脆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.51,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:56.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,到最后只会被大家拒绝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:02.65,Text CN,,0,0,0,,留奈子我\N也受不了这种优柔寡断的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:05.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我们的想法一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我…被说受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:17.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,什么要确定对方心意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,什么靠气势
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我害怕到做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:27.17,Note,,0,0,0,,运动会执行委员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:27.17,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那么有没有人要当执行委员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那我来当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,还要再一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:36.68,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,今年的运动会执行委员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:42.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就是这两位同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好多道具哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:56.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,要确认备品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:56.33,Note,,0,0,0,,运动会备品清单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,今天确认得完吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.33,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:04.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,现在有我们两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:06.84,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(怦咚 怦咚…)\N没事…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,快问快问快问快问
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:13.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,两个人 只有我们两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:14.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这是好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可以问那天亲吻的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.00,Note,,0,0,0,,扭扭捏捏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是 万一她打算
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.10,Text CN,,0,0,0,,当作一场意外 不想去在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,也可能是我做了白日梦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.61,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:29.86,Text CN,,0,0,0,,关于Kiss…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:32.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不能是奇数对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.75,Note,,0,0,0,,与Kiss同音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,要偶数吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:39.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(奇数 奇数 Kiss Kiss)\N就…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:41.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,奇数…很奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:49.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,拜托不要让我混乱啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:51.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好尴尬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:55.14,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我跟英雄 接吻了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,第一次接吻…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是他却…为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,为什么他却无动于衷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.29,Note,,0,0,0,,不变
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:07.40,Text CN,,0,0,0,,为什么都是我在紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我…我亲了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,跟英雄接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:15.75,Note,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:15.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,突然被人亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,一定会觉得很讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是 没有一万也有个万一…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:24.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他搞不好其实很开心…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,但也可能觉得很困扰…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:32.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可是可是可是 有个亿分之一的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:33.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,发展成恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.77,Text CN,,0,0,0,,总之 先表现得跟平常一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:47.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:50.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:55.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,咦 咦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:58.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,障碍物竞赛专用袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:00.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这里有四个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:02.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.70,Text CN,,0,0,0,,他在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好想问…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,接吻的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.55,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(啾)\N突然一阵头晕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:21.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 障碍物专用袋子亲…上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:22.81,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:24.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,这招如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,感情真好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,啾 啾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,顺势玩起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.44,Text CN,,0,0,0,,搞不清楚她要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,难道跟我接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.75,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:38.37,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,好相爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:38.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,也不会让他在意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:41.45,Text CN,,0,0,0,,她该不会是在捉弄我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:41.45,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,相亲相爱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.50,Text CN Top,,0,0,0,,你都不知道我有多在意你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你都不知道我有多在意你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.46,Text CN,,0,0,0,,(用力…)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:50.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,别玩了 快点确认完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:57.97,Text CN,,0,0,0,,英雄 你果然不喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:03.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不喜欢跟我…K…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,没什么 继续工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:17.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那边就拜托你咯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:22.58,Text CN,,0,0,0,,要先说清楚哦 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:32.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,三…三天前的那件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就是你主动…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.72,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:39.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:41.37,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.41,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:44.72,Text CN,,0,0,0,,K?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:48.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.11,0:21:02.49,Text CN,,0,0,0,,Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那就继续工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:09.00,Note,,0,0,0,,运动会 项目竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:24.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好期待运动会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:27.87,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就是明天了 时间过得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那我要回去咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:33.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我留下来确认一些事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:34.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,好 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:41.54,Text CN,,0,0,0,,她是2班的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.91,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是水萌同学
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:44.79,Text CN,,0,0,0,,她好有干劲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:51.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.97,0:21:58.94,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}darlingあまのじゃくでごめんね
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.97,0:21:58.94,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}darling 抱歉我这么别扭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:04.32,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}会いたいって言いたいの
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:04.32,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}想见你才是我的真心话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:21.58,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}書いては消して丸めた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:21.58,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}写了又擦掉 揉成一团的信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:27.25,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}手紙にだけ教えた気持ち
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:27.25,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}只有它知道我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.25,0:22:30.04,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}伝えたいけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.25,0:22:30.04,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}想传达给你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:32.80,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}壊したくない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:32.80,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}却不想破坏现在的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:37.07,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}隣にいられたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:37.07,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}只要能待在你身边就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:44.47,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}いつか誰かを愛してしまうの？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:44.47,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}可总有一天你会爱上别人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:49.73,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}こんな近くで想い続けてるのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:49.73,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}明明离你这么近还是一直想着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.73,0:22:54.61,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}darlingあまのじゃくでごめんね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.73,0:22:54.61,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}darling 抱歉我这么别扭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.61,0:22:58.07,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}裏返してみて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.61,0:22:58.07,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}试着反过来看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.07,0:23:01.95,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}本音のかくれんぼ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.07,0:23:01.95,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}这是真心话的捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:06.29,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}不器用なりのラブソング
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:06.29,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}如果随着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:09.50,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}歌に乗せたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:09.50,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}笨拙的情歌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:13.54,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}素直になれるかな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:13.54,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}是不是就能坦率一点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:18.80,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}冗談混じりの好きじゃなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:18.80,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}不是夹杂玩笑的那种“喜欢”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:22.78,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}あなたに恋、してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:22.78,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:ED_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,250)}而是真的恋上了你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.54,0:23:27.01,Text CN,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:30.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我没办法好好跟英雄说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:35.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,早知道就不亲他了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:40.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,灯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:43.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,汐 原来你在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.95,Text CN,,0,0,0,,占用你一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:50.03,Note,,0,0,0,,第10话 就算亲了就算又亲了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:50.03,Note,,0,0,0,,就算沉浸在余韵中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:50.03,Note,,0,0,0,,就算当运动会执行委员\N恋爱喜剧也无法成立
